2,Proto-Indo-European Etyma: 18. Language & Music,https://lrc.la.utexas.edu/lex/semantic/field/LM_SC,"This page lists Proto-Indo-European lexical entries (PIE etyma) drawn from Julius Pokorny's Indogermanisches etymologisches Wörterbuch (2 vols, 1959-69) assigned to the semantic field Language & Music, subcategory 18.13. to Shout, Cry Out. Category numbers are as defined by Carl Darling Buck (cf.",Nimadi,Indo-European
